    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "stepping back feels like a joke. there's nothing to step back to. it's not just a phase or being burnt out, it's like the well is actually dry. permanently. everything i do feels fake and pointless now. why keep trying to find a voice that isn't there anymore?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
